# --- STM32CubeIDE / Eclipse metadata ---
# Only /.settings/ is per-machine and disposable -- CubeIDE regenerates it.
# .cproject and .project are TRACKED and must stay that way: .cproject carries the
# CDT managed-build configuration, .project is what makes Eclipse see a project at
# all, and neither is regenerated into an existing folder. Untracking them breaks
# every other checkout on pull. See HANDOFF.md, "Build settings".
# M4-4205D_Control.ioc and .mxproject stay tracked -- the first is the MCU
# configuration itself, the second is what CubeMX needs to regenerate correctly.
/.settings/
#/.cproject
#/.project

